{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:04.34]Gun 'em down, bee, with a fifty, brr, bee, uh\n[00:08.04]Gun 'em down, uh, oh my God, huh\n[00:11.58]Ya dig? Whew\n[00:13.00]999 shit, ayy\n[Chorus]\n[00:14.48]When I'm in town (Yeah), party's goin' down (You dig? It's goin' down), uh\n[00:19.08]Shoot 'em down (Baow) with a fifty round (You dig? A fifty round), ayy\n[00:22.90]Run the town (What?), ballin' hard, you outta bounds, you dig? (Swish) Uh, ayy\n[00:26.46]So much money, damn it, I forgot the count (Cash, cash, cash, you dig?)\n[00:29.30]Ayy, look at my bank account (You dig?), uh\n[00:32.04]Look at the cash amount, uh (You dig?)\n[00:34.06]I get the cash, I'm out (You dig? Yeah)\n[00:35.82]I do the dash, I'm out (You dig? Yeah)\n[00:37.56]Look at my bank account (You dig?), uh\n[00:39.42]Look at the cash amount (You dig?), uh\n[00:41.30]I get the cash, I'm out (Lick), uh\n[00:43.18]I just be cashin' out (You dig? Skrrt)\n[Verse]\n[00:44.92]Walk in that bitch and I'm faded, uh\n[00:46.88]I fuck that bitch when I'm faded\n[00:48.02]I got the M&M's (Millions), I called my mom, told her, \"I made it\"\n[00:52.14]Yeah, mama, your son too famous (Yeah), he on everybody playlist\n[00:55.90]But he's still armed and dangerous, he'll pop at a stranger\n[00:59.70]Sippin' lean, cliché, I still do it anyway\n[01:03.46]Red or purple in a cup, which one shall I pick today? Ayy, ayy\n[01:09.40]Sippin' 'Hardt, gun on me, no need for bodyguard\n[01:14.50]Aim at your body parts, yeah\n[01:16.32]Take off your body parts, yeah\n[01:18.04]I'm swingin' when I'm off the ecstasy (Uh), that's a Molly park, yeah\n[01:22.16]Iron on me, hoo-hoo, that's a Tony Stark, yeah\n[01:25.56]Pourin' fours in a twenty ounce soda pop, yeah\n[01:29.72]I'm O.C, three-gram 'Wood full of OG (Huh)\n[01:32.24]Give BM dick like Moby (Uh), gun make him flash, Adobe, uh\n[01:35.90]Pay up that cash, you owe me, yeah, huh, bitch, I need it\n[01:39.88]Matter fact, fuck that shit, I'm rich, uh, you can keep it\n[01:43.52]Yeah (Bit